      </div>
      <div class="case-prose case-insight" data-reveal>
        <p><strong>問題を後工程で見つけるのではなく、デザインプロセスそのものに検証を組み込んだ。</strong></p>
      </div>
      <p><a class="external-article-button" href="https://caddi.tech/figmaless_design" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CADDi Tech Blogで全文を読む <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
    </section>

  </div> -->
</CaseStudyLayout>

<style>
  .ai-native-workflow { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .ai-impact-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); border: 1px solid var(--divider-color); }
  .ai-impact-grid article { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; min-height: 260px; padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px); border-right: 1px solid var(--divider-color); }
  .ai-impact-grid article:last-child { border-right: 0; }
  .ai-impact-grid strong { margin-top: auto; font-size: clamp(64px, 9vw, 128px); font-weight: 500; line-height: .85; letter-spacing: -.07em; }
  .ai-impact-grid span { font-size: clamp(14px, 1.2vw, 17px); line-height: 1.6; }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .ai-hero-article .external-article-button { font-size: 14px; }
    .ai-impact-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .ai-impact-grid article { min-height: 210px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider-color); }
    .ai-impact-grid article:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }
  }
</style>
